WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.300
Everyone has a story worth hearing.

2
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:06.900
Some of us just need time to tell it.

3
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:12.900
With quietinterview, I get the questions and answer in my own time.

4
00:00:13.717 --> 00:00:15.717
I can reflect on each question,

5
00:00:15.917 --> 00:00:18.517
record my answer, and listen back.

6
00:00:19.317 --> 00:00:21.517
If I want, I record again.

7
00:00:22.417 --> 00:00:24.417
Nothing is published without my approval.

8
00:00:25.325 --> 00:00:27.225
My photo can even be animated,

9
00:00:27.525 --> 00:00:30.025
always clearly labelled as AI.

10
00:00:30.717 --> 00:00:32.917
My words are carefully translated,

11
00:00:33.317 --> 00:00:36.817
so my experience reaches people in many languages.

12
00:00:37.208 --> 00:00:39.608
Professional cultures and life lessons,

13
00:00:39.608 --> 00:00:42.308
shared across countries and generations.

14
00:00:42.808 --> 00:00:43.808
quietinterview.

15
00:00:45.058 --> 00:00:46.158
Great interviews,

16
00:00:46.558 --> 00:00:48.308
recorded in your own time.
